  unitName: Menacing Ragbarrett
  unitId: 40803
  unitNumber: 1433
  description: A massive automaton found in the world of Bectas. Having been sighted
    commanding smaller machines of the same type to gather information, it is thought
    to serve a role much like a control tower. Since destroying this type of massive
    unit would greatly reduce the difficulty of future surveys, the Akras Summoners'
    Hall has prioritized their discovery and elimination. Additionally, caution is
    required during exploration due to the individual combat abilities of these massive
    automatons.
  summonDesc: Attention...admin...this...is control...tower. Sub-unit...addition...required...
